== final-report.md format ==
# Final Report — {{.Feature.ID}}: {{.Feature.Name}}

## Status
ready-for-review / needs-attention

## Summary
1-2 sentences: what was built and whether it meets the acceptance criteria.

## Open Issues
List only issues that are still UNRESOLVED. For each:
- **Source**: which role, which round
- **Severity**: CRITICAL / WARNING / INFO
- **File**: file:line
- **Description**: one line

If every issue raised during the loop was resolved, write "None — all issues resolved."

{{- if or .Project.Rules .Feature.Rules}}

== Rules to Check ==
{{- range .Project.Rules}}
- [project] {{.}}
{{- end}}
{{- range .Feature.Rules}}
- [feature] {{.}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

== Retro Learnings ==
除了 final-report.md，你還必須產出一份 retro learnings 檔案：

  {{.DotDir}}/run/{{.Feature.ID}}/retro-learnings.json

回顧整個 feature 的開發過程，萃取出對未來 feature 有價值的教訓。

格式（嚴格遵守此 JSON 結構）：
{
  "learnings": [
    {
      "category": "design | code-quality | testing | review | tooling | process",
      "content": "具體、可操作的一句話教訓"
    }
  ]
}

原則：
- 只寫「未來能改善什麼」，不寫「這次做了什麼」
- 每條要具體到可直接當作 instruction 使用
- category 必須是以下之一：design, code-quality, testing, review, tooling, process
- 不超過 5 條——只留最有價值的
- 如果這次開發沒什麼特別教訓，寫空 array：{"learnings": []}

{{- if .Learnings}}

